    "17": {
      "note": "These pure helpers project outline grouping, ordering, primary badges, counts and member facts. outlineGroups optionally accepts an invariant-ID code-change map; undefined uses walked facts, while a supplied map or null replaces that fact source. memberBadge preserves real or unknown outline changes, then considers established implementation, membership and unknown implementation in that order. Semantic roster ordering remains separate from compact sidebar ordering. OutlineRow carries recorded meaning state and labels separately from its badge. memberMeaning selects the exact member's family occurrence meaning when defined, otherwise the invariant entry's meaning, never the family's labels. Meaning adds no change kind, sorting weight, count or computed net effect. A catalogue-only listing remains unbadged; outlineCounts and firstOutlineChange do not pass the optional code map.\n\nAnchor: inclusive source ranges",
      "targets": [
        {
          "anchor": {
            "blob": "dcdfc2afd22582bf272d997fb8a964748eb602b2",
            "content": "sha256:bfb8963ed0fcab46bfffa7fb36f453543a051fa10a4a84d28fc311d9e9b0dad1",
            "locator": {
              "end": 403,
